    },
    {
     "id": "dk",
     "type": "label",
     "x": 640,
     "y": 540,
     "text": "Danish navy, 2021",
     "color": "#7ad3ff",
     "d": 1.4,
     "in": 1
    },
    {
     "id": "ac",
     "type": "text",
     "x": 640,
     "y": 610,
     "text": "according to Saad: no prison, asylum, an integration plan",
     "size": 24,
     "d": 4.0,
     "color": "#c9d3ff",
     "weight": 700,
     "in": 1
    }
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "He describes Western activists, including some gay activists, cheering for movements whose leaders would not tolerate them. To Saad, that's empathy that never checks where it's aimed."
    },
    {
     "text": "And he tells the story of a Nigerian pirate who was wounded in a firefight with the Danish navy in 2021. According to Saad, instead of prison, the man ended up with medical care, asylum, and an integration plan in Denmark."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "card",
   "id": "ch6",
   "style": "chapter",
