   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "A hummingbird and a cassowary are both remarkable. You just need to know which one you're dealing with."
    },
    {
     "text": "Saad's challenge is to see other people clearly, not as reflections of ourselves. His critics' challenge is to see them as individuals. A wise society probably needs both."
    },
